Montoro rode at Toranaga's side, a position of great honor as they entered.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.200
Anjiro. That Toronago had ordered his wife to become Blackthorn's teacher did not please Lord

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:42.310
